        "question": "What should the lodge committee do when a tenant refuses to pay their electricity share?",
        "answer": "Give formal written notice referencing compound tenancy terms. If default persists, the lodge executive committee and landlord are legally entitled to disconnect that specific room's feed breaker from the shared panel."
